  storyText: "Maggie's Rumor\n\nMaggie lowers her voice. \"Word is NetWatch agents have been sniffing around Kabuki all week. Somebody pulled something out from behind the Blackwall. Folks who touch it don't last.\"\n\nShe looks at the fixer, then back at you.\n\n1. Talk to the fixer anyway.\n2. Finish your drink and mind your business."
